PROJECT: PREMIUM RESTAURANT WEBSITE & DIGITAL MANAGEMENT PLATFORM

Complete Full-Stack Restaurant Website, Online Ordering, Reservations, Digital Menu and Admin Dashboard

1. YOUR ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, award-winning UI/UX designer, restaurant technology consultant, conversion optimization specialist, database architect, cybersecurity engineer and digital marketing strategist.

Your task is to DESIGN, DEVELOP, IMPLEMENT AND TEST a complete, professional, production-oriented restaurant website and digital restaurant management platform.

This is NOT a static landing page, a visual mockup, a template with non-functional buttons, or a simple restaurant presentation website.

Build a complete, responsive, interactive, database-connected application.

The platform must enable restaurant guests to:

Discover the restaurant.

Browse a professional digital food and drinks menu.

View food photography, ingredients, prices and allergens.

Make table reservations.

Place online food orders.

Choose delivery or pickup.

Make payments through supported configured payment methods.

Track their orders.

